DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The gglleennvv driver provides support for the Genesys Logic GL518SM hardware
     monitor to be used with the sysctl(8) interface.

     The GL518SM possesses a voltage sensor, a temperature sensor and two fan
     speed sensors.

